    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Class hierarchy for digital assets";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "digital asset means: (a) a digital representation of value or rights (including rights to property), the ownership of which is evidenced cryptographically and that is held and transferred electronically by: (i) a type of distributed ledger technology; or (ii) another distributed cryptographically verifiable data structure;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "digital asset";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::dl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
